   "tests": [
     {
       "id": "anderson_category_1",
       "description": "Reference: NCAR fire_behavior (develop @ eb77580, default real32 build, gfortran 13.3 -O2 in the EqWeFiC container) running its own test7 case (real Colorado domain, 80x80 fire cells of 25 m, dt = 0.5 s, 20 steps, num_tiles = 1), dumped in-model by the ctessum-claude/fire_behavior fork (branch earthsciml-instrumented, commit c9dda02, -DESM_DUMP=ON; the dumped run's summary output is bit-identical to the uninstrumented build). Single-precision source, so rel 1e-5 (CLAUDE.md contract); a real64 re-evaluation of the same formulae agrees with the dumps to <= 8e-7 relative. Regime: category 1 (Anderson 1982 model 1); table values from the ros_params dump (Init), class weights from the fmc_avg dump of the moisture run, waf from the fuels%waf array, fuel_time from the fuel_left dump at a cell of this category.",
